WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.360
Hear, Israel: the Lord is our God.

2
00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:05.460
The Lord is one.

3
00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:07.340
Jesus quoted these words.

4
00:00:07.390 --> 00:00:10.460
Christians hold to them: there is one God.

5
00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:13.070
Yet Christians baptise in
the name of the Father,

6
00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:15.360
the Son and the Holy Spirit.

7
00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:17.920
The word Trinity is not in the Bible.

8
00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:20.800
It names a belief Christians
find in the Bible.

9
00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:23.360
So how can Christians believe in one God,

10
00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.950
yet pray to the Father, the
Son and the Holy Spirit?

11
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.850
In this mission, you'll
decode an old diagram,

12
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.610
the Shield of the Trinity.

13
00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:36.050
Then you'll weigh up an objection:
that the Trinity is a contradiction.

14
00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:39.920
Your mission: find out how
Christians can believe in one God,

15
00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:42.610
yet pray to Father, Son and Spirit.
